\par\b\fs28 \u167?7 Podcast rendering\b0\fs24\par


\par One physical image: a child in a pitch-dark room flipping the light switch \u8212? and wanting to do it a hundred times, to pause over one wonder: there can be light, because He spoke it. And beside it the water and sand you mix and then watch separate again: creating is making separation, making clarity. So the Word works in a confused mind \u8212? it divides and clarifies, and it stands even when all the lights go out.\par



